class_name Ai4141
extends AiShapedFormation
## 4-1-4-1 (F04), after tactico.pro/formations/4-1-4-1.
## A flat four in front of a screen: the holder never presses, he delays; wide mids tuck in or jump the full back; the lone striker presses the centre back.
## The play is in ai_shaped_formation.gd. The numbers of this formation are NOT in code: open scenes/ai/profile_default.tres, AiProfile > Formations, click this formation, and edit them in the inspector (hover a name for what it means).
